      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53443842818078/huge/3cc22610c55a5d94aa9cc5e122b2b519edf936ee.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Sun, 09 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The Freshman Pinning Ceremony is a formal rite of passage that marks the official induction of new students into the Howard University family. During the ceremony, students receive their Howard University pin, a symbol of their commitment to academic excellence, leadership, service, and the University's values. The event serves as a meaningful moment of reflection and celebration, connecting students to the rich traditions, history, and legacy of Howard University as they begin their collegiate experience.</p>

